-- WoW Forever quests that are in neither our world nor the other Forever server, built from the Wowhead Forever quest pages
-- (infobox, objective list with item/npc ids, texts, rewards, g_quests data) and the 70532 client.
-- Only quests whose giver, turn-in, targets and items already exist in our world and that pass the usability audit.
-- XP difficulty from QuestXP at the quest level; rep rewards as exact overrides; money in quest_classic_money.
-- INFERRED: drop chance 35% for objective items on the creatures the page pins as their source (100% for Stormheart's heart);
-- "repeatable" from Wowhead flag 16; quests the page gives only a side for are open to every race of that side.
-- Reward items that are not in the 70532 client are left out (Source of Power, The Grave Knight).
-- Not added (see the report): no giver/turn-in/objective data on the page, NPCs or objects we don't have (Duskwood Missions,
-- Orgrul's Desolace chain, Ravenholdt Syndicate chain, ...), items with no source anywhere, and the Legacy Reward quest.

-- 65602 What Is Love? (level 20, required 20) -- Wowhead Forever page
