INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) VALUES (93225,'These are beautiful--I underestimated the creativity of the centaur. I never would have imagined that a race so full of brutality and cruelty would be able to appreciate stories told through carvings.$B$BI suppose appreciating them takes way less effort than crafting them. Let me rephrase: I never would have imagined the centaur to be patient enough to carve out so many tales in wood. Where are they getting the wood?$B$BIn any case, speak to me when you are ready to make your delivery.',0);
